            {
              "id": "art-body",
              "type": "column",
              "props": {
                "span": 9
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "id": "lede",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "If you've ever felt your truck pulling slightly to one side or noticed uneven tire wear, you've probably asked yourself the same question most owner-operators do: Is a truck alignment service really worth it right now, or can it wait?",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full",
                    "anchor": "post-lede"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-intro-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "For many business owners, every expense has to make sense. You're not spending money just to spend it. You're investing in keeping your truck running efficiently, avoiding bigger problems, and protecting your bottom line. At Sun State International, we take a straightforward approach. Alignment isn't about upselling a service. It's about preventing issues that cost you far more down the road.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-what-is-alignment",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "What Is a Truck Alignment Service?",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "what-is-alignment"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-what-is-alignment-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "A truck alignment service adjusts the angles of your wheels so they meet the manufacturer's specifications. This ensures your tires make proper contact with the road and your truck drives straight and stable.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-what-is-alignment-2",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "This applies across:",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "checks-what-is-alignment-3",
                  "type": "check-list",
                  "props": {
                    "items": [
                      {
                        "text": "Standard truck alignment services"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Semi truck alignment services"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Even specialized needs like classic truck alignment service for older models"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-what-is-alignment-4",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "When alignment is off, your truck has to work harder to stay straight. That strain shows up in your tires, your fuel usage, and your overall performance.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "co-what-is-alignment-5-row",
                  "type": "row",
                  "props": {
                    "gap": 0
                  },
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "id": "co-what-is-alignment-5",
                      "type": "column",
                      "props": {
                        "span": 12
                      },
                      "styles": {
                        "base": {
                          "borderWidth": 1,
                          "borderStyle": "solid",
                          "borderColor": "line",
                          "paddingTop": 26,
                          "paddingRight": 28,
